      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَّى</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمٌّ</span>, in six places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Dust;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَبَرَةٌ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Darkness.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And
(assumed tropical:)  <i>Hardship,</i> or <i>difficulty,</i> or <i>distress,</i> [<i>as though</i>]
<i>covering</i> [or <i>overwhelming</i>] <i>a party in war,</i> or
<i>battle.</i> (K.) See also the next paragraph.

